  "body": "## What changed\nFiles: `.github/workflows/post-merge.yml`, `xtask/tests/post_merge_stall.rs`, `AGENTS.md`, `.claude/skills/runners/SKILL.md`, `docs/decisions/3535-post-merge-step-limit.md`.\n- Workflow, step \"Batch gate tier\": `timeout-minutes: 45` is now `timeout-minutes: 75`.\n- Workflow, step \"Gate summary\": the test `\"$mins\" -ge 44` is now `\"$mins\" -ge 74`.\n- Workflow: the comment above the step limit names 74 minutes and says that a cold build can take more than 45 minutes (#3535).\n- `xtask/tests/post_merge_stall.rs` line 18: the pinned `timeout-minutes: 45` is now 75. Without this change the test is red on main.\n- `AGENTS.md` (\"Runner stops\"): \"stops at 45 minutes\" is now \"stops at 75 minutes\".\n- `.claude/skills/runners/SKILL.md` line 105: `timeout-minutes: 45` is now `75`.\n- New decision file `docs/decisions/3535-post-merge-step-limit.md`.\n\n## Why\nPR #3363 added the dependency `wgpu` and the crate `camcraft-gpu`. Each runner must build `app`, `gpu` and `ui` from a cold state one time. That build does not complete in 45 minutes. Runs 45045638947 and 45046106061 ended in a build step. No test ran.\n\nMaintainer decision: step limit 75 min (owner, question dialog 2026-11-22)\n\n## Not changed\n- The job limit of 90 minutes.\n- The 15-minute watchdog of `xtask` for a silent step.\n- Each trigger (`on:`) and each runner label. Each other workflow (`release.yml` line 449 is a different workflow).\n- `AGENTS.md` line 835, \"A gate job with no output at 50 minutes is a runner stop\". It is about a job with no output, not about the step limit. The watchdog kills a silent step at 15 minutes, so the sentence stays true with a 75-minute limit.\n- `docs/decisions/3303-gate-stall-watchdog.md`: a record of a past decision.\n- `xtask/tests/post_merge_stall.rs` lines 72 and 92: sample text \"after 45 min\". No assert ties it to the workflow value.\n\n## Gate\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p xtask --test post_merge_stall`: 1 passed, 0 failed (on Windows; the `script` module is unix only).\n- `git grep -n \"timeout-minutes: 45\\|ge 44\" -- .github xtask .claude AGENTS.md` finds only `.github/workflows/release.yml:449` (another workflow).\n- The workflow YAML parses (PyYAML `safe_load`).\n\nNot exercised: the workflow did not run with the new limit.\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\n\nRefs #3522\nFixes #3535\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
